From: Slot-20 reproducibility record
Subject: [PATCH] package/fakeroot: create build-aux before autoreconf

Backport the Buildroot post-patch hook from commits
fd1bcce9894773d7e1c1ca5be0f04b0b32128a1d (master) and
519dd1f6e043809cd5f389d8bff86cb95180390f (2019.02.x).

Fakeroot 1.20.2 declares build-aux as its aclocal macro directory but omits
the directory from the release archive.  Create it before Buildroot's
autoreconf step.  This patch applies after the C2b-2b-1 change that enabled
HOST_FAKEROOT_AUTORECONF.

---
 package/fakeroot/fakeroot.mk | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/package/fakeroot/fakeroot.mk b/package/fakeroot/fakeroot.mk
--- a/package/fakeroot/fakeroot.mk
+++ b/package/fakeroot/fakeroot.mk
@@ -22,0 +23,5 @@ FAKEROOT_LICENSE_FILES = COPYING
+define HOST_FAKEROOT_BUILD_AUX
+	mkdir -p $(@D)/build-aux
+endef
+HOST_FAKEROOT_POST_PATCH_HOOKS += HOST_FAKEROOT_BUILD_AUX
+
